<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani cotton yarn rates close up.</title>
<headline>Pakistani cotton yarn rates close up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed up on Wednesday after domestic cotton prices rose in the last few days, dealers said.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for a 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:</p>
<p>				     Weds	  Dec 1</p>
<p>    Baig (Magic brand)	 475	   470</p>
<p>    Popular (Shangrilla)     475	   474</p>
<p>    Shafiq			 465	   465</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
